From ce3b0c6678a9e19bc4041aeb05217a6c68535a51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:40:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] lockdown: implement the Lockdown portal backend

The portal frontend refuses camera, microphone and other requests when
the Lockdown backend says so, but we had none. Serve its dash-named
properties from a connection of our own and keep them in our config.

BUG: 447034
---
 data/CMakeLists.txt                           |   5 +-
 data/kde-lockdown.portal                      |   4 +
 ....impl.portal.desktop.kde.lockdown.cmake.in |   4 +
 src/CMakeLists.txt                            |   2 +
 src/desktopportal.cpp                         |   2 +
 src/lockdown.cpp                              | 105 ++++++++++++++++++
 src/lockdown.h                                |  29 +++++
 7 files changed, 149 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 data/kde-lockdown.portal
 create mode 100644 data/org.freedesktop.impl.portal.desktop.kde.lockdown.cmake.in
 create mode 100644 src/lockdown.cpp
 create mode 100644 src/lockdown.h

diff --git a/data/CMakeLists.txt b/data/CMakeLists.txt
index b21f9a32..1f62db30 100644
--- a/data/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/data/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,8 +1,9 @@
